This rule detects the repeated use of the same expression in conditional statements, which can lead to unnecessary redundancy and affect the readability and maintainability of the code.

######## Rule Meaning
The repetition of logical conditions may lead to errors or misunderstandings. Reusing the same condition can reduce redundancy and enhance the clarity and maintainability of the code.

